  "description": "Mashrabya by Lattafa is a bold, deep fragrance built around smoky oud, warm resins, and rich sweetness , delivering a powerful Middle Eastern character. The opening introduces a warm, slightly sweet resinous tone that immediately feels dark and luxurious. The heart develops into smoky oud and woody depth , creating an intense, confident presence. In the base, amber, vanilla sweetness, and smooth woods soften the darkness, leaving a long-lasting, addictive trail that feels rich and enveloping. Mashrabya is designed for those who enjoy strong projection, deep warmth, and unapologetic oud intensity .",
